# Client (Vite) build-time variables. Copy to client/.env or set them in your
# host's build environment. Only names prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the app.

# Microsoft Clarity — free heatmaps + session recordings (optional).
# 1. Create a free project at https://clarity.microsoft.com (add your domain).
# 2. Copy the Project ID (a short string like "abcd1234ef").
# 3. Put it here, or set VITE_CLARITY_ID in your Hostinger build environment.
# The ID is public (it ships in the page), so committing it is fine.
# NOTE: the project's real ID (xny7te0wup) is already baked in as the default
# in client/src/lib/clarity.js, so Clarity works without setting anything here.
# Setting VITE_CLARITY_ID overrides that default (e.g. a separate staging ID).
#
# PRIVACY: the app tracks the whole site including the member area. In the
# Clarity dashboard set Masking to "Strict" so personal data (names, weights,
# measurements) is masked in recordings.
VITE_CLARITY_ID=

# Giphy — auto GIF of the exercise in the video modal (optional).
# Shown when an exercise has no linked video, until you add one. Create a free
# key at https://developers.giphy.com (the key is public / client-side). Without
# it, the modal falls back to a YouTube "how to <exercise>" search.
VITE_GIPHY_KEY=
